          "content": "<p>识使人自由，或者起码渴望自由。</p>\n<p>-- [南非] 特雷弗·诺亚<a href=\"https://book.douban.com/subject/30125030/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">《天生有罪》</a></p>",
